    "title": "Training source audit",
    "caption": "A, The actual 2026 Geneformer V2 Genecorpus-104M source inventory, genecorpus_104m Excel row 319 including header, lists DOI 10.1038/s41588-021-00894-z (GSE174367) and 61,770 brain cells passed filtering. The published scFoundation training table, Sheet1 rows 8622-8640, lists DISCO-GSE174367 and all 19/19 official snRNA GSM5292838-GSM5292856 accessions, totalling 45,508 reserved cells. These are published study/sample inventory quantities, not exact evaluated-cell intersections. B, Evidence layers are distinct: study source, RNA GSM accession, actual weight/corpus applicability and exact evaluated cells. Green is positive observed source or model-version evidence; orange marks the unclosed original BioMap-to-cell-mirror bridge; question marks are unresolved. Geneformer local V2-104M weights and gc104M dictionaries are bound to the same official Hugging Face revision 04c2b2e84da7c0f385c3f9ad8f3ec24bab6650e5; the actual checkpoint SHA256 is fff5cba29ddd8792991fa77b4872246fbe548a178cebda3775cdc72b67780e7f. The 104M source inventory applies at published source resolution, not the V1 30M inventory. It has 2,903 data rows, 549 normalized distinct DOIs and 44 non-DOI rows, including generic portals; absence of GSE strings or DOI hits is not training exclusion. Its 103,568,569 listed cells differ from the corpus card's 103,877,737 by 309,168, reinforcing version/snapshot limits. C, The 19 scFoundation GSM entries map to all 18 corrective selected sample IDs plus Sample-101. Sample-101 lists 1,662 reserved cells but is absent from current RNA metadata; no cell overlap or donor identity is imputed. D, The scFoundation study-name table describes 522 of 656 training-project IDs; 134 training projects are absent, including the GSE174367 project, so absence from that shorter table cannot erase positive training-table evidence. All plotted source rows were reread from hash-bound local downloaded workbooks. The local scFoundation checkpoint is bound to the perturblab/scfoundation-cell mirror, but original BioMap checksum or state-dict conversion equivalence is unclosed. Actual scGPT whole-human and UCE 4-layer training membership remain unresolved; a 33-layer UCE publication inventory cannot stand in for the 4-layer ledger. Exact training/evaluation cell and person identity is unknown for every model. GSE194122, GSE213740 and the distinct historical 10x PBMC object are not certified never-pretrained from identifier absence.",
